add("ryn_schedule_validate", "Check a declared sequential balance/calendar/capacity plan, not optimize it. Read workspace CSV/JSON rows: unique id, ISO date, subject, outflow, inflow, units, counts_as_operation boolean; optional reported_balance. Decimal amounts as strings, max 2 decimal places. Each row pays out BEFORE receiving inflow; represent delayed receipts as separate later rows, never net before checking liquidity. Rules explicitly name assumptions, opening balance, unit, optional working_weekdays (0=Mon), excluded_dates, daily_capacity, period_start/end and scoped subjects with units/deadline. No calendar or interest rules are guessed. Returns shortfalls, scope/quantity/date violations and a fixed-operation-count capacity bound. Passed verifies declared arithmetic only, not source truth, bank rules, settlement, feasibility of an optimized plan or authority to act.", "read", {"source_path": PATH, "rules": SCHEDULE_RULES}, ["source_path", "rules"])

NAMES = frozenset(SPECS)
